                "text": "I promised to bring more of Utah to D.C., and my bill\u2014the Healthy Lunch for Healthy Kids Act\u2014does just that by removing ultraprocessed foods from schools and replacing them with nutritious meals that support kids' growth, development, and success.\nhttps://t.co/PYJQrJC9Dd",
