                "text": "Biotech plays a vital role in Utah\u2019s economic growth, public health innovation, and scientific advancement. It is crucial that we eliminate barriers hindering America\u2019s biotech innovation to maintain a competitive edge against adversaries such as the CCP. https://t.co/EtgZIGvLpf",
