                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I support the USDA\u2019s decision to grant Utah a waiver to remove soda from SNAP benefits. Taxpayer dollars shouldn\u2019t fund unhealthy foods\u2014whether in school lunches or SNAP. This is a smart step for better health and respects Utah\u2019s right to local control.\n\nhttps://t.co/OVktxcHNfv",
