                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Spent the morning working in the district, meeting with Encompass Health Rehabilitation Hospital of Utah in Sandy. We got an inside look at their facility and had a productive conversation on the incredible work they\u2019re doing. \n\nAlways great to connect with local providers and hear directly from those serving Utah families. Their perspective is invaluable as I continue to advocate for my constituents in Washington.",
