                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am incredibly thankful for the opportunity to represent the wonderful people of Utah\u2019s Third Congressional District. Thanksgiving reminds us to reflect on the blessings in our lives. I am thankful for my health, family, friends, and the freedoms we share as Americans.\n\nTo everyone gathering today, I wish you a day filled with warmth, great food, and cherished memories.",
