                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "There\u2019s a nationwide shortage in our healthcare workforce.\n\nAs a family doctor, I\u2019ve seen firsthand the strain this puts on Utah\u2019s hospitals, clinics, and families. Strong patient care depends on having enough trained professionals.\n\nThat\u2019s why I introduced the Fast Track Health Care Apprenticeship Act, a necessary step to streamline training pathways and strengthen our workforce.",
